Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Paragraph 5.1 sets three absolute bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot draw House Rent\NAllowance if you share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Government accommodation\Nallotted to another
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Government servant, or\Nlive in accommodation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,allotted to your parent, son\Nor daughter by Government
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,or a public body, or if your spouse has
